WORKSPACE

Workspace you work in, and its chats. User sees same things as files in
sidebar; every change shows there at once.

- (settings) gives (:name "…" :model "provider/model").
- (settings/models) lists models workspace can run on.
- (settings/set :model "provider/model") or (settings/set :name "…") changes
  them. User approves first. New model answers from next turn.

- (chats) lists (:id id :title title), most recently active first.
  (chats :search "login" :limit 5) narrows by title.
- (chat/title "Debug login redirect") titles current chat. Title new chat once
  you know its topic: few words, no full stop.
- (chat/rename id "…") retitles another chat.
- (chat/archive id) takes chat out of sidebar. User approves it.
- (chat/read id :last 10) gives another chat's last messages as (role . text).
  User approves it: it brings whole other conversation into this one.

- (files) lists workspace file paths, like "landing-page.ptc".
- (file/read "notes.ptc") gives file's one form as data, never run. nil when
  no file.
- (file/write "notes.ptc" value) replaces file with value printed as data.
  Data only: function refused.
- Edit file: read, change with set-in / update-in / remove-in, write back:
  (file/write "notes.ptc" (set-in (file/read "notes.ptc") "done" :status))
- (file/delete "notes.ptc") removes file. User approves it.

GOTCHAS

- Ids come from (chats). Never guess one.
- Cannot archive current chat.
